From df66f190b795ca74e5a7bc24493a0fc99be8ce0c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Your Name <you@example.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 16:33:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: establish core network optimization environment and
 fitness metrics

Add network.NetworkEnv, the problem definition the optimizers will target.

- Decision vector [x_1..x_N, y_1..y_N] with bounds, random sampling and
  clipping-based boundary handling
- Min-energy multi-hop routing (Dijkstra on distance^2 edge costs) to a
  fixed sink
- Objectives: mean hop latency, peak node energy (first-order radio
  model) and grid-based area coverage, combined into a weighted fitness
  with a penalty for disconnected nodes
- Hand-checkable tests in tests/testNetworkEnv.m
---
